From 015cd592db36b4332e6637d167a04b0ae889a8a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:20:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): every local kanban_create result carries its
 placement reason; note local pins with no local need [daveey]

Pins, "needs ..." and plain local decisions returned no placement block and logged
only at DEBUG, so 41 of 148 MacBook cards were unattributable in the placement
re-measure. They now return {where: local, why} (logged at INFO), and a
placement='local' pin on a card that would run elsewhere without the pin gets a
note naming that target. The placement decision is unchanged.
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_placement.py              | 11 +++-
 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_placement.py   | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_worker_node.py |  4 +-
 tools/kanban_tools.py                       | 23 +++-----
 tools/kanban_tools_placement.py             | 35 +++++++++++-
 5 files changed, 111 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

